{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2022-04-06 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS MARCH SALES RESULTS', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., APRIL 06, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY REPORTED NET SALES OF $21.61 BILLION FOR THE RETAIL MONTH OF MARCH, THE FIVE WEEKS ENDED APRIL 3, 2022, AN INCREASE OF 18.7 PERCENT FROM $18.21 BILLION LAST YEAR.'}